      "problem": "Which of the following angles are coterminal with $\\theta =-\\frac{2\\pi }{3}?$\n\n- $\\frac{4\\pi }{3}$\n- $\\frac{10\\pi }{3}$\n- $-\\frac{8\\pi }{3}$",
